The User API Wish List
######################

Sparsity Calculations
*********************
Provide a way to calculation sparsity between elements of a tensor.
This might make higher order sparse derivatives feasible for huge tensors.

Simpler Examples
****************
Some of the examples are complicated because they are also being used as tests.
Move these examples to the tests directory and make simpler examples.

{xrst_end wish_user}
